  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate potato and squeeze out excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, melt the butter in the microwave in 10 second bursts.\n• In a large bowl, combine grated potato, garlic & herb seasoning, the plain flour, melted butter and a generous pinch of pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a3922b64e4b173945bcf67d/step-41d1f300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of potato mixture in batches, then flatten with a spatula (you should get 3-4 per person).\n• Cook until golden, 4-6 mins each side (don’t flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a3922b64e4b173945bcf67d/step-e1077410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook the eggs until cooked to your liking, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a plate.\n• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Remove from heat, add the honey and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a3922b64e4b173945bcf67d/step-98b65d20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil.\n• Layer potato rosti and haloumi to form a stack on each plate. Top each stack with a fried egg.\n• Drizzle with sweet chilli sauce and light sour cream. Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a3922b64e4b173945bcf67d/step-0701c130.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
